{"2779400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Intown Nightmares", "steam_appid": 2779400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Intown, a city shrouded in nightmares.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intown is a city built around a scientific station where nightmares become reality. Follow the nightmares' influence on Intown over time in seven unique stories, each set in a different time and place in the city, from the 1970s to 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/5d2bf10f52ddb431385b04d61acee8d9.poster.avif?t=1788201856\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/5d2bf10f52ddb431385b04d61acee8d9.webm?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/5d2bf10f52ddb431385b04d61acee8d9.mp4?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore locations filled with horror.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Intown Nightmares, you'll find dark streets, creepy houses, and a gloomy forest. Uncover the connections between them to unravel the city's secrets and find a way out of the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/f2d2f6da707417ed92f634904c7ff76f.poster.avif?t=1788201856\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/f2d2f6da707417ed92f634904c7ff76f.webm?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/f2d2f6da707417ed92f634904c7ff76f.mp4?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles and fight monsters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive in Intown, you'll have to solve puzzles and, in some stories, fight monsters. Use your weapons and wits to defeat your enemies and find a way out of the nightmare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/979a6ec6dac5f6f7cba3f30c3bcbd4e4.poster.avif?t=1788201856\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/979a6ec6dac5f6f7cba3f30c3bcbd4e4.webm?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/979a6ec6dac5f6f7cba3f30c3bcbd4e4.mp4?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a nostalgic atmosphere: PS1-inspired graphics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intown is a visually stylized game with pixel art inspired by the aesthetics of the PS1. Enjoy cool lighting, detailed textures, and a unique retro horror atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/f41846d3b95b2bf471ed55063ab96c45.poster.avif?t=1788201856\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/f41846d3b95b2bf471ed55063ab96c45.webm?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/f41846d3b95b2bf471ed55063ab96c45.mp4?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Mystery of the Nightmares</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What caused the nightmares in Intown? What is their purpose? Uncover the mystery of the nightmares and find a way to stop them before they destroy the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/cd63ebc0e379e0935f654c28810f82f3.poster.avif?t=1788201856\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/cd63ebc0e379e0935f654c28810f82f3.webm?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/cd63ebc0e379e0935f654c28810f82f3.mp4?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intown Nightmares</strong> is a horror anthology that will leave you with an unforgettable experience. Play through seven unique stories, explore a city full of terror, meet unforgettable characters, solve puzzles, and in some stories, fight monsters. Uncover the mystery of the nightmares and save Intown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/5da2b6552338fe359d5313af4b6c2948.poster.avif?t=1788201856\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/5da2b6552338fe359d5313af4b6c2948.webm?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/5da2b6552338fe359d5313af4b6c2948.mp4?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven unique stories set in different times and locations across the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and monster battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great graphics and music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of the nightmares and save the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3-4 hours of gameplay including cutscenes</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Intown, a city shrouded in nightmares.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intown is a city built around a scientific station where nightmares become reality. Follow the nightmares' influence on Intown over time in seven unique stories, each set in a different time and place in the city, from the 1970s to 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/5d2bf10f52ddb431385b04d61acee8d9.poster.avif?t=1788201856\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/5d2bf10f52ddb431385b04d61acee8d9.webm?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/5d2bf10f52ddb431385b04d61acee8d9.mp4?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore locations filled with horror.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Intown Nightmares, you'll find dark streets, creepy houses, and a gloomy forest. Uncover the connections between them to unravel the city's secrets and find a way out of the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/f2d2f6da707417ed92f634904c7ff76f.poster.avif?t=1788201856\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/f2d2f6da707417ed92f634904c7ff76f.webm?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/f2d2f6da707417ed92f634904c7ff76f.mp4?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles and fight monsters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive in Intown, you'll have to solve puzzles and, in some stories, fight monsters. Use your weapons and wits to defeat your enemies and find a way out of the nightmare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/979a6ec6dac5f6f7cba3f30c3bcbd4e4.poster.avif?t=1788201856\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/979a6ec6dac5f6f7cba3f30c3bcbd4e4.webm?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/979a6ec6dac5f6f7cba3f30c3bcbd4e4.mp4?t=1788201856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a nostalgic atmosphere: PS1-inspired graphics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intown is a visually stylized game with pixel art inspired by the aesthetics of the PS1. Enjoy cool lighting, detailed textures, and a unique retro horror atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/f41846d3b95b2bf471ed55063ab96c45.poster.avif?t=1788201856\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://sha